_non-accredited-investors.htm">OSC: Accredited-investor financial-assets test</a> — Financial assets net of related liabilities</li></ul><h2>Validation</h2><p>Automated checks cover duplicate content, answer structure, coverage, counts, all legacy answer permutations, saved progress, study modes, worked calculations and weighted mock exams. Text checks cannot prove semantic uniqueness; further additions still need editorial review.</p><p><a href="../index.html">Open the study site</a></p></html>
